+ *
+ * The RK3326 is the PX30 die without VOP lite, GMAC and with a slightly
+ * different OPP set: 4x Cortex-A35, GIC-400, Mali-G31.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+ */
